  CLAUSE 1 -- THE DOSE: f3 must separate better with render_f3_gain ON and
  render_bw_gain OFF (cell 0 -> cell 1), by more than 2.447 x its PAIRED SE.
  Required of f3 alone; bw3 is the third resonator's own width and so has
  nothing to act on at f3_gain 0, which §41 did not notice.
    f3    cell 0   -0.010  ->  cell 1   23.539   delta   23.549 +-  0.321  MOVED
    bw1   cell 0    0.026  ->  cell 2    0.610   delta    0.584 +-  0.038  MOVED
